# Phase 13 (CLAUDE.md §17): keep the build context to exactly what the Dockerfile needs — the
# solution file and the four application projects' source. Everything else (tests, docs, VCS
# metadata, local build output, editor state) never reaches the image, let alone a layer.

.git
.github

# Local build output — always rebuilt inside the image; copying it in would risk stale binaries
# and only bloats the build context.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Test projects are never part of the runtime image.
tests/

# Documentation and repository-management files — not needed to build or run the application.
docs/
*.md
CLAUDE.md

# Local development artifacts.
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Local-only configuration that must never be baked into an image (CLAUDE.md §17: "no
# appsettings.Production.json with values, no .env in the image"). appsettings.Development.json
# carries the local-only Postgres password (already reviewed/approved as dev-only) — it has no
# reason to exist inside a Production-environment container, so it is excluded from the build
# context entirely rather than merely unused at runtime.
.env
.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
